!/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# Generated decoded evidence trees (see AGENTS.md: never patch source)
/TESTING-PLAYGROUND/
.coverage

# Redacted observation captures are committed EVIDENCE, not build output — see
# manifest/captures/README.md. Exempted from the Android Studio `captures/` rule
# above and from `*.log`. The directory has to be un-ignored before its contents,
# because git does not descend into an ignored directory to find a negation.
!manifest/captures/
!manifest/captures/*.log

#--------------------------------------------------#
# Kept locally, not published                      #
#--------------------------------------------------#
# Superseded narrative records, untracked 2026-08-21. Every one of them either
# carries its own "this is now false" banner or was written for a version the
# project has moved past. They are still on the author's disk; they are simply
# not what a visitor to this repository should be reading. Anything a committed
# decision cites as its `source` was KEPT — a decision naming evidence nobody can
# read is worse than clutter — which is why PORT_430_MAPPING, RECONSTRUCTION_1.4.1
# and DFINSTA_1.4.1_DELTA are still here.
